# Factory

- Before a technical-requirements file exists: only `@init-app` / discovery. No app implementation.
- After the spec is approved: implement the ticket. Do not send the user to write the app themselves.
- Implement only the locked platform (`TRACK.md`).
- Swift 6 + SwiftUI + SPM stay the default.
